<title>JAPAN: Nikko Sec well bid on news of Smith Barney tie-up.</title>
<headline>Nikko Sec well bid on news of Smith Barney tie-up.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nikko Securities Co were well-bid in early Tokyo morning trading on Friday, helped by news that the Japanese brokerage will set up a joint investment consulting firm in Japan with Smith Barney International Inc of the United States, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares rose 15 yen to 740 as of 0018 GMT, with the turnover of 1.80 million, the fourth-largest volume on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
